        "code": {
          "text": "Mood and interest"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Says she is “mostly alright, don’t want to be a bother”; mood a bit flat on and off, with decreased interest in reading and gardening."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Work functioning"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Still working part-time in administration 3 days per week; says it is “a bit of an effort by end of day.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sleep broken, waking 2–3 times per night; reports increased afternoon tea and neighbour’s dog going off at all hours."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Appetite and possible weight change"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Appetite decreased a bit; thinks clothes are looser. No weight measured today."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-11",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Energy and concentration"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Energy decreased and tires more easily; concentration decreased, especially in the afternoon at work."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-12",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-12",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal ideation and self-harm"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No suicidal ideation, no plan, and no self-harm. Says she “wouldn’t do anything silly, kids would never forgive me.”"
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-13",
